# Cube, volume and z-stencil objects.
# D-1: cube texture creation always fails (per-face glBindTexture is invalid in core GL).
# D-2: volume texture getters are unimplemented stubs (0 / UNKNOWN).
create
enter
cube c 4 RGBA 1 0
cube c2 4 RGBA 1 RENDER_TARGET
vol v 2 2 2 RGBA 1 0
volinfo v
vol vd 2 2 2 RGBA 1 DYNAMIC
vol vm 2 2 2 R8 0 0
zs z16 4 4 Z16
zs z24 4 4 Z24_S8
zs z32 4 4 Z32F
zs z32s 4 4 Z32F_S8X24
zs znone 4 4 ZS_NONE
destroy
